; beancount rejects a transaction with more than two strings once it has
; read it to its end. A line that breaks the transaction off before that,
; an invalid token right under it or a line of its body that is none,
; leaves only its own error: the transactions on lines 7, 10 and 14 are
; not reported, and the one on line 18, which ends at a blank line, is.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-02 * "one" "two" "three"
2020-13-01 open Assets:A

2020-01-03 * "one" "two" "three"
  Assets:A  1 USD
2020-13-01 open Assets:A

2020-01-04 * "one" "two" "three"
  Assets:A  1 USD
  garbage here

2020-01-05 * "one" "two" "three"
  Assets:A  1 USD

